# BACKEND — out of scope

This folder is not Agent API.

Never add Express routes, controllers, DB repositories, or server-side business logic here.

If the website needs a new endpoint or contract change, request it from **Agent API** (`cursor-node-api`) and say **I am from the Website portal**. Use the existing `ApiService` HTTP client only.
